  "description": "HUNTS YOU THROUGH THE DAY. For hardtail enthusiasts, KTM provides an impressive selection even with motor support. The MACINA TEAM 800Wh range is characterized by exceptional frame stiffness and thoughtfully selected components. The variety in the Team range is hard to beat, as the bikes are available in both 29” and 27.5” versions. Two highlights of the series are the LIGHT-FENDER-CARRIER (LFC) models, which are fitted with lights, mudguards and a luggage rack as standard, and the TEAM XL, designed to support a maximum system weight of 177 kg. The Performance Line CX (BDU384Y) takes riding dynamics and agility to a whole new level. It is powerful, light and quiet (120 Nm max. torque, 750-Watt max. motor power, 600% max. support factor). The Power Tube battery provides 800 Wh. POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) is KTM’s innovation for user-friendly battery handling. Removing and reinserting the battery becomes a breeze.",
